# Product requirements (PRDs)

Product vision and requirement docs, seeded during project setup and extended as
the product evolves. `prd-000` is the product vision (the "why"); number features
and follow-on requirements from `prd-001`. Each PRD is YAML frontmatter (`id`,
`title`, `status`, `type`, `created`) plus a short markdown body
(Problem → Vision → Goals → Notes).

To add another, copy an existing file, bump the number, and link it below. Re-run
`project-setup` any time — it never overwrites an existing PRD.

